Dph9n.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、その光景を見た4期生の先輩方が、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙でいっぱいになりながら喜んでいる姿にも心を打たれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頼もしい背中をずっと見せ続けてくださっていた先輩方も、不安と隣り合わせで一年を歩んできたのだと思うと胸がいっぱいになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobsLK1OU.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勇気をだして梅さんに話しかけて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてツーショットを撮れた時の写真。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて紅白の舞台に立たせていただいたのは2022年。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右も左も分からなかったあの頃とはまた違う気持ちで、今年もこの特別なステージに向き合いたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これまでの歩みの重みをしっかり抱えて、感謝を忘れずに立ちたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年末まで忙しい日々が続くと思いますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな皆さんと一緒に最後まで駆け抜けられたら嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと変わらずに私達のことを好きでいてくださって、応援してくださって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"br